messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 50 and 74? Please reason step by step.', '<think>.\nTo solve the problem of finding the product of 50 and 74, we can follow these steps:.\n1. Understand that the product of two numbers is the result of multiplying them together.\n2. Recognize that 50 and 74 are both two-digit numbers, which means we will need to use the standard multiplication algorithm.\n3. Set up the multiplication problem as follows:.\n   50.\nx 74.\n4. Multiply 50 by 4 (the units digit of 74):.\n   50.\nx  4.\n------.\n   200.\n5. Multiply 50 by 70 (the tens digit of 74, which is 7 times 10):.\n   50.\nx 70.\n------.\n   3500.\n6. Add the two results together:.\n   200.\n+3500.\n------.\n   3700.\nTherefore, the product of 50 and 74 is 3700.\n</think>.\n<answer>. Therefore, my final answer is: ']]
