8^6 \\]\n   (since there are 78 choices for each character if only uppercase letters and digits are allowed)\n\n4. **Combinations without at least one digit:**\n   \\[ \\text{Combinations without digits} = 94^6 \\]\n   (since there are 94 choices for each character if only uppercase letters and lowercase letters are allowed)\n\n5. **Combinations without at least one special character:**\n   \\[ \\text{Combinations without special characters} = 94^6 \\]\n   (since there are 94 choices for each character if only uppercase letters, lowercase letters, and digits are allowed)\n\n6. **Combinations without at least one uppercase letter and one lowercase letter:**\n   \\[ \\text{Combinations without uppercase and lowercase} = 52^6 \\]\n   (since there are 52 choices for each character if only digits and special characters are allowed)\n\n7. **Combinations without at least one uppercase letter and one digit:**\n   \\[ \\text{Combinations without uppercase and digit} = 78^6 \\]\n   (since there are 78 choices for each character if only lowercase letters and special characters are allowed)\n\n8. **Combinations without at least one uppercase letter and one special character:**\n   \\[ \\text{Combinations without uppercase and special character} = 78^6 \\]\n   (since there are 78 choices for each character if only lowercase letters and digits are allowed)\n\n9. **Combinations without at least one lowercase letter and one digit:**\n   \\[ \\text{Combinations without lowercase and digit} = 78^6 \\]\n   (since there are 78 choices for each character if only uppercase letters and special characters are allowed)\n\n10. **Combinations without at least one lowercase letter and one special character:**\n    \\[ \\text{Combinations without lowercase and special character} = 78^6 \\]\n    (since there are 78 choices for each character if only uppercase letters and digits are allowed)\n\n11. **Combinations without at least one digit and one special character:**\n    \\[ \\text{Combinations